@startuml ScreeningSeatDto State Diagram

title ScreeningSeatDto - State Diagram

hide empty description

state "FREE" as Free
state "PENDING" as Pending
state "RESERVED" as Reserved

[*] --> Free : Seat available

Free --> Pending : Create reservation

Pending --> Reserved : Payment successful
Pending --> Free : Reservation expired
Pending --> Free : Reservation cancelled

Reserved --> Free : Reservation cancelled

note right of Free
    Seat is available
    for reservation.
end note

note right of Pending
    Seat is temporarily blocked
    for 5 minutes.
end note

note right of Reserved
    Seat is reserved
    for this screening.
end note

@enduml
